  (text "CV outputs: two MCP4822 (internal 2.048 V reference, gain 1x) and unity buffers" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f0ca1072-1ad0-5f8d-8fda-07e89954c0ca"))
  (text "CV = (0, , 2.048) V, 1 V/oct, MIDI note 24 = 0 V, note 36 = 1 V, note 48 = 2 V; higher notes saturate (ARCHITECTURE.md, CV Circuit)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b56a57fb-3d15-5807-bdf6-0957e9c76adf"))
  (text "The DACs run from +3V3, so only the default gain 1x is possible: -DREBIRTH_CV_DAC_GAIN=2 (0-4.096 V) would need the DACs on" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "79f01abb-ca53-5477-924e-397d2aff42c8"))
  (text "VBUS and 3.3 V -> 5 V buffers on DAC_SCK/DAC_MOSI/DAC_CSx_N. The buffers already run from VBUS and have the headroom." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3af57f31-b543-5b5e-b8e7-d892b5dab14f"))
  (text "CV 1" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 163.83 64.135 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524) (thickness 0.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cb87d518-5291-5071-80e0-182a80e23e93"))
  (text "CV 2" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 163.83 92.075 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524) (thickness 0.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "11d0220a-6a66-5beb-a9a2-69f93a116e10"))
  (text "CV 3" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 163.83 127.635 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524) (thickness 0.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9c22ffbe-d916-5466-9d1f-d540d014f6db"))
  (text "CV 4" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 163.83 155.575 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524) (thickness 0.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "86243b73-8c7b-54b1-bb43-bacf24bfbe7b"))
  (text "U503 MCP6004 (rail-to-rail, VBUS): unity gain at DC. R511-R514 (1 k) sit inside" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "962c9fde-de72-56fe-a3b8-7d12466151cc"))
  (text "the loop: R521-R524 (10 k) take the feedback from the jack side, C511-C514" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bda35cab-3234-5ec8-8e92-b40d86490e83"))
  (text "(1 nF C0G) close the loop at high frequency, so the load does not shift the pitch" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 55.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b6e87e14-194d-5361-b5a3-7586f3e162b0"))
  (text "and cable capacitance does not upset the stage (SPICE: 6 % overshoot at 1 nF, 28 % at" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "540cc166-d022-52b4-a514-f5a1ffa5225f"))
  (text "10 nF; SIMULATION.md). R515-R518 (100 k) hold the inputs at 0 V while the DACs are" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5b293e31-4717-5042-b195-12acdfee8099"))
  (text "unpowered or in their power-on shutdown. Near 0 V the jack follows the DAC only above" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "031c363c-568d-5535-8916-f2080774256e"))
  (text "~10 mV (MCP4822 output swing; the MCP6004 reaches ~0.2 mV into a grounded load):" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 66.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "74558309-9025-55fa-b360-738a6a69799e"))
  (text "up to ~17 cents sharp at note 24 with the op-amp offset. DAC gain/offset errors (about" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "81c1f166-98c2-5722-ab49-033df49e5bd0"))
  (text "+-2 % FSR) and op-amp offset need a per-channel calibration in firmware; no trimmers." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 71.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a29c0dbf-579d-5917-b0cd-8d0a1a60dc56"))
  (text "R511-R514 limit a short to GND to ~5 mA; external voltages are not clamped." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 73.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "736c66ca-332a-5024-b31f-a3f5e4d95085"))
  (text "J501-J504: rear 3.5 mm TS jacks (PJ398SM type) to a synth's pitch CV input." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "da35ac1c-dfbf-5e0d-b10e-1178d29b9254"))
  (text "Gate outputs: 3.3 V GPIO -> 5 V gates" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 181.61 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a6869ac0-d4aa-5a66-9a0b-ee9e0c240ed1"))
